      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i've checked the amount and currency/format and they look spot on according to the docs. im also pretty sure the auth token is working since other endpoints are responding fine. i'm starting to think maybe there's something sneaky happening with how the payload is being parsed or some hidden requirement i'm missing. any specific ways to log the outgoing request to see if something is getting mutated or lost before it hits their server?",
